WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,580
Okay, okay, no problem. Go get busy.

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:07,380
Get off the board. Please come in. The room is shabby. I hope Boss Xia won’t find it objectionable.

3
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:13,580
Boss Xia, please sit down. Boss Xia, please have some water.

4
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:17,480
Boss Xia came all the way. Is there anything I can do to help you?

5
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,680
You know, the little shop sells rice and water.

6
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:22,280
But the store is located in the city center and few people know about it.

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,880
No matter how low the price is, it is a waste of resources if no one knows about it.

8
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,280
Then I understand what Boss Xia means.

9
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:29,280
Boss Xia wants me to help promote the hotel, right?

10
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:32,280
Boss Xia, leave this matter to me. The publicity must be in place.

11
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:35,480
I also brought some Japanese rice and water today. The price is the same as the price at the hotel.

12
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:36,880
See if you can organize it

13
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:39,880
This is fine too. Boss Xia, wait here for a while while I go out.

14
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,480
Wait, those with gold boxes will be given priority. You need to apply for a card.
